#. module: base_invoicing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:base_invoicing.product_category_form_view
msgid ""
"The billable items model must have a numeric field\n"
"                                    (\"Integer\" or \"Float\") containing the billable amount.\n"
"                                    If this field is not specified, the billable amount\n"
"                                    for each record in the billable items model will be\n"
"                                    assumed to be 1 (optional field)."
msgstr ""
"Al model d'elements facturables hi ha d'haver un camp numèric\n"
"                                    (\"Integer\" o \"Float\") que contingui la quantitat a facturar.\n"
"                                    Si no s'indica aquest camp, s'assumirà que la quantitat a facturar\n"
"                                    és 1 a cada registre del model d'elements facturables."

#. module: base_invoicing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:base_invoicing.product_category_form_view
msgid ""
"The fields above are auxiliary data from the billable\n"
"                                    items model. There is one field of type \"Char\", another\n"
"                                    of type \"Integer\", a third of type \"Float\", and a final\n"
"                                    field of type \"Boolean\". Assigning a value to any of\n"
"                                    these fields will cause the corresponding informational\n"
"                                    column to be displayed in the tree view of selectable\n"
"                                    items (when configuring a lot). Further below, two\n"
"                                    additional groups of auxiliary fields are shown, serving\n"
"                                    the same purpose as this first group."
msgstr ""
"Els camps anteriors són dades auxiliars procedents del model\n"
"                                    d'elements facturables. Hi ha un camp de tipus \"Char\", un altre\n"
"                                    de tipus \"Integer\", un tercer camp de tipus \"Float\" i un darrer camp\n"
"                                    de tipus \"Boolean\". En el moment de configurar un lot, cadascun\n"
"                                    dels camps anteriors farà que es mostri la corresponent columna\n"
"                                    a la vista tree d'elements seleccionables. Més avall es mostren dos\n"
"                                    grups de camps auxiliars més amb la mateixa funció que aquest primer grup."

